Given numbers n and k, unset the kth bit of number n. Rightmost bit is considered 0th bit and so on.

Input Format:
the first line contains two integer n and k.

Output Format:
Print the decimal number after unsetiing the kth bit

Constraints:
1 <= 10^5 <= n
0 <= k <=31

